{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1H25sm6P9lbwJkGYjDAr8A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:25.114351+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1H25sm6P9lbwJkGYjDAr8A","html":"<div><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>北京第二外国语学院日语学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>日语语言文学与翻译（日语）</span></span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026年优秀大学生夏令营招生简章（一号通知）</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>     北京第二外国语学院日语专业创建于1964年，2020年入选国家级一流本科专业“双万计划”，是教育部第一批特色专业建设点、北京市特色专业建设点、重点建设学科和品牌专业。北京第二外国语学院日语学院“日语语言文学”专业研究生培养下设日语语言学（日本语教育）、日本文学、日本社会与文化、翻译学四个方向。学院现有教师36名，其中特聘教授3名，教授9名，副教授12名，讲师12名，外聘日籍专家3名。杰出校友从专家、学者到国务委员、部长、大使等遍及海内外各个领域。与日本大阪大学、广岛大学、早稻田大学、杏林大学、上智大学、明治大学、关西学院大学、名城大学、爱知大学、樱美林大学、京都外国语大学以及美国纽约州立大学宾汉姆顿分校等30多所多学科、特色大学开展国际交流与合作，出国留学机会100％，年出国率50％以上，其中公费项目占比超过50%。代表性留学项目有：专硕1+2双学位；学硕1+2双学位；硕博连读、博士升学项目等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>     为了服务国家外交战略，服务首都四个中心建设，提升区域国别研究、文明阐释与国际传播能力建设的研究水平，促进日语语言文学专业的内涵式发展和跨学科研究，北京第二外国语学院日语学院计划在2026年7月11-12日举办“2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXCSj4PUibVhXRibs9cIwtyiaKDFCfTJvibuCJwzzREQ3p8E32rgHJfzjxDiaUP5ribwic3kSE8p92BdicOjcQnLAMogJ52CWLa33rlbMxM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年夏令营简介：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>北京第二外国语学院日语学院“2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动旨在通过名家讲座、导师见面会、专题研究工作坊、参观体验人工智能与语言认知实验室、同声传译实验室等方式，促进全国高等院校日语专业间的互动和交流，加强不同高校日语专业优秀大学生对我院的了解，选拔具有综合学术科研能力且具有研究潜力的优秀学员。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>本次夏令营主要面向</span><span><span>（1）语言交叉学科研究、（2）东亚古典研究、（3）人工智能与二次元文化研究、（4）人工智能与翻译传播研究</span></span><span>四个方面展开招募，计划招收学员约30人，欢迎有意报考申请我院日语语言文学专业研究生的同学报名参加。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请资格：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LjibAlBdgzXDNibUAEyLjpkYUYPWglLJNSN0icUj9dyfn7tTSpqekJpiaibL0dZiaef45oQRib0u7rib9W8kJV91zEtDWiaRlXibBwmSXbHJQUVgCaww0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>申请人应同时满足如下条件：</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，遵守法律、法规和学校的规章制度，品德良好。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>2. 大学本科三年级学生（2027届毕业生），学习成绩优异，报名时总评成绩排名在本专业前30%（优先具备推免资格者）。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>3. 有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研能力。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>4. 身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请材料：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXAyOMs882Txo0stSo2SSnEBnqSqw7icIYIUJaMUDWrhyoJca0ichVFzpjVDGIJyq628qPjqDthBXBhlj3MavMMjFNbFNXXYZXUek/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.附件一“北京第二外国语学院日语学院优秀大学生夏令营报名表”（须本人签字，加盖教务部门或学院公章）。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>2.由教务部门或学院出具附有盖章的成绩单。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>3.身份证和学生证复印件。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>4.其他证书、获奖材料（包括日语专四证书、日语能力考试1级证书及成绩单、各类比赛获奖证书）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请程序：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXCgw0icJiaOqlwWqgaBkNOZpcM8Hq9NVibJqkLcM7mErKRuK2yYp9FRF8m59ausbVOGYgTZl9hjPXlxBY2n4285KibnBCwKWmFNWYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.报名时间：2026年5月18日-6月15日</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>请有意向报名参加夏令营的同学在5月18日-6月15日将申请材料（ 附件一“北京第二外国语学院日语学院优秀大学生夏令营报名表”、盖章成绩单、身份证学生证复印件、其他证书获奖资料）的PDF版发送至邮箱：wangxinyun@bisu.edu.cn。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>2.确定选拔营员名单：2026年6月30日</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>成立专门审核小组，审核申请材料并择优遴选营员名单，于2026年6月30日以邮件方式公布营员名单。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>3.确认核实参加夏令营的营员名单：2026年7月3日</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>入选营员须在收到录取邮件之日起2日内回复邮件确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃资格，名额由候补申请者递补。未接到入营通知的同学为未入选，不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动日程安排:</span></p><p><span>2026年7月11日-12日，</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营期间所有活动均以</span><span><span><span>线下方式</span></span></span><span>进行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>注意事项：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXAWic9fLYdQ8cgibiaFlgsxhuvYTSAeh6icaA9pHxmZvtKHlP8TwiaEb2yuJ8khOqJClfiaGBKTKqUePKeHqiaqxBzJQfUZbS6KT80Jps/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.申请人承诺填写的信息真实、准确、有效。凡提供虚假信息者，一经发现立即取消入营资格；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>2.招生人数：30人左右；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>3.时间：2026年7月11日-7月12日；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>4.地点：北京市朝阳区定福庄南里1号北京第二外国语学院；</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>5.费用：夏令营活动不收取任何费用，住宿、交通、餐食等费用由营员自理，建议预订北京第二外国语学院周边酒店。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>欢迎大家踊跃报名参加此次夏令营活动。如果由于营员数量有限而未能参加的同学，也欢迎大家继续关注北京第二外国语学院日语学院的活动信息。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span><p><span><span>欢迎广大学生报考我院研究生！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系方式：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXBcBNAU6Of06VTjvVj650fE5pg2Aey3mT5bAoAvZnJ0L6ztB0uicL7GwSP1oI108R424Wfh2t2ot0XfchSYDTSVWEBRHN9EQVEk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>材料发送邮箱：wangxinyun@bisu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>联系人：王老师 </span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：（010）65778438</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>                                        </span></span></p><p><span><span>                                          北京第二外国语学院</span><span><span>日语学院</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>                                          2026年5月18日</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>下载附件</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>直接下载附件一</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/LjibAlBdgzXDPJHS2woSYm045BXvjmqiaM3CTib9dDUSIeAgeK6MrWZDufsEq6zZEs4pce2yhNs7zv6FnuE6EI4tRmibibMeEwLLImkLugft2v5w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b430d215838634cd4f2213dc58e743d62e52a1c62f7c46ec05efa1e36649c176","textLength":1869,"sourceSha256":"a98392209f3fb748f7531e9d151b163b22d40c89d38fb70a93713dbdcf696f72","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-32b70c31a9f024a82104","title":"2026年北京第二外国语学院日语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营招生简章（一号通知）","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:25.114351+00:00"}
